  "html": "<p>🚨<strong> Camino Popup Event</strong> 🚨<br><strong>When</strong>: <strong>3/21</strong> from <strong>3-5 pm</strong><br><strong>Where</strong>: Highway 90 Dispensary, Marlton NJ</p><p><a href=\"/brands/camino/\"><img data-ref=\"https://www.thehighway90.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Camino.NJ_.Family_HScreen-2048x1152.jpg\" alt=\"Camino cannabis edibles available now at highway 90 dispensary in marlton, new jersey.\"></a></p><p>We’re excited to announce that <a href=\"/brands/camino/\"><strong>Camino Edibles</strong> </a> are now available at Highway 90 Dispensary, and we’re celebrating with a special <strong>Popup Event</strong> you won’t want to miss! Whether you’re a seasoned cannabis connoisseur or just beginning to explore the world of edibles, Camino has something for everyone.</p><p><strong>Why Camino?</strong><br>Camino Edibles offers a range of gummies tailored to suit your needs—whether you’re looking for a burst of energy or a relaxing, mellow experience. With sativa, hybrid, and indica options, each gummy is crafted with unique terpene blends that help enhance your mood, focus, or relaxation. Plus, they come in delicious, fresh fruit flavors made from all-natural ingredients—because edibles should taste as good as they make you feel!</p><p><strong>What’s Happening at the Popup Event?</strong><br>Join us on March 21st from 3-5 pm and learn more about Camino Edibles. Brand Reps from Camino will be at Highway 90 and will be on hand to answer any questions and help you find the perfect gummy for your needs. Plus, you’ll have the chance to grab exclusive deals and promotions only available during the event!</p><p><strong>The Camino Family</strong></p><ul><li><strong>Sativa Gummies:</strong> Energizing and uplifting, perfect for when you need a boost to your day.</li><li><strong>Hybrid Gummies:</strong> A balanced experience that provides the best of both worlds—relaxation with a bit of energy.</li><li><strong>Indica Gummies:</strong> Perfect for winding down, these will help you relax and prepare for a restful night.</li></ul><p><strong>Don’t Miss Out!</strong><br>Mark your calendars and stop by the <strong>Camino Popup Event</strong> at Highway 90 Dispensary on March 21st. Explore the world of Camino Edibles, discover your favorite gummy, and elevate your experience with every bite.</p><p>We can’t wait to see you there!</p>",
